{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04588","headline":"五君咏五首 郭代公元振 · 张说","name":"五君咏五首 郭代公元振","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"代公举鹏翼，悬飞摩海雾。\n志康天地屯，适与云雷遇。\n兴丧一言决，安危万心注。\n大勳书王府，舛命沦江路。\n势倾北夏门，哀靡东平树。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04588.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04588","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}